<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto">
  <h1>Help & FAQ</h1>

  <div class="stack-lg">
    <details class="card">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer">
        How do I register?
      </summary>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">
        Click <a href="/register">Join HOSA</a> in the top bar. You'll need your
        email, a password (at least 5 characters), and your graduation year.
        Registration takes less than 2 minutes.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="card">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer">
        How do I get access to the alumni dashboard?
      </summary>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">
        New accounts are reviewed by an administrator before member features
        unlock. If your membership is still pending, contact an administrator
        from the
        <a href="/pending-approval">pending approval page</a> to request access.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="card">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer">
        How do I change who can see my profile?
      </summary>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">
        Log in and go to your <a href="/dashboard/profile">Profile</a>. Under
        "Visibility & Privacy", you can control whether your profile appears in
        the public directory, and whether your email and phone are visible.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="card">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer">
        How do I post a job or internship?
      </summary>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">
        Log in and go to
        <a href="/dashboard/opportunities/new">Post an Opportunity</a>. All
        listings are reviewed by a moderator before appearing publicly. Reviews
        typically take 24–48 hours.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="card">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer">
        How do I request a mentor?
      </summary>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">
        Browse the <a href="/directory?mentor=1">directory</a> filtered to
        mentors. Click on a member who is available for mentorship, then click
        "Request mentorship" on their profile. They will receive your request
        and can accept or decline.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="card">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer">
        How do I report content?
      </summary>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">
        Each job listing, story, and profile has a "Report" button. Reported
        content is reviewed by HOSA moderators. For urgent matters, email
        <a href="mailto:support@hosa-uganda.org">support@hosa-uganda.org</a>.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="card">
      <summary style="font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer">
        How do I delete my account?
      </summary>
      <p style="margin-top: var(--space-3)">
        Email
        <a href="mailto:privacy@hosa-uganda.org">privacy@hosa-uganda.org</a>
        with your account email. We'll process your deletion within 30 days as
        required by Uganda's Data Protection and Privacy Act.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>
